{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong><i>\u3010Your Majesty, the demon tribe is about to invade, we need your command\u3011</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The demon clan is coveting the kingdom, and the common people are in dire straits. The kingdom's soldiers urgently need the ruler's command!!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997350/extras/9de1fa833ef8f08e0f6cc03fc38e9986.avif?t=1770115706\" width=538 height=186 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the game, you will play as the monarch of the kingdom, recruiting soldiers to resist the invasion of the demon race.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The mysterious wizard will bring random spells to assist you (perhaps to turn the tide on the battlefield?)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random magic will grant benefits to your subordinates, but be aware that sometimes it may also make the enemies stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997350/extras/5827e43c4f12ed3a9379c288acbdeca4.avif?t=1770115706\" width=82 height=81 /></span><i>\u3010Oh no, Your Majesty, my skills are lacking; the magic may help the soldiers, but it could also aid the enemies.\u3011</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please remember, Your Majesty, that you are not alone; the nuns in the city are ready to assist your subordinates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997350/extras/fed23e6b119710d9de4d3b4f7bb98264.avif?t=1770115706\" width=72 height=84 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also upgrade your soldiers during the intervals of defending the kingdom, which will help you better protect the kingdom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997350/extras/aa01961e806b52ec85e133c5297640d4.avif?t=1770115706\" width=564 height=157 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997350/extras/27e274b66757ae11b3d0a66934a6fbdc.avif?t=1770115706\" width=352 height=258 /></span><i>\u3010Each type of arrow has a different effect!\u3011</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The soldiers are fiercely battling in the northern snowy plains, and besides that, there are the Witch's Forest and the Empire Plains waiting for your protection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997350/extras/e8f1ebbb6174f4a2aa7ca998312bd7b7.avif?t=1770115706\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready, Your Majesty! Your decisions will forge the strongest army, and your will shall become the kingdom's most solid defense.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3997350?t=1770115706","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3997350?t=1770115706","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997350/80b7e8b2be82f658dfed4d6ddfdcf9c17fe4d019/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770115706","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997350/80b7e8b2be82f658dfed4d6ddfdcf9c17fe4d019/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770115706","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"descr