red.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997350/extras/fed23e6b119710d9de4d3b4f7bb98264.avif?t=1770115706\" width=72 height=84 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also upgrade your soldiers during the intervals of defending the kingdom, which will help you better protect the kingdom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997350/extras/aa01961e806b52ec85e133c5297640d4.avif?t=1770115706\" width=564 height=157 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997350/extras/27e274b66757ae11b3d0a66934a6fbdc.avif?t=1770115706\" width=352 height=258 /></span><i>\u3010Each type of arrow has a different effect!\u3011</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The soldiers are fiercely battling in the northern snowy plains, and besides that, there are the Witch's Forest and the Empire Plains waiting for your protection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997350/extras/e8f1ebbb6174f4a2aa7ca998312bd7b7.avif?t=1770115706\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Get ready, Your Majesty! Your decisions will forge the strongest army, and your will shall become the kingdom's most solid defense.</p>","developers":["KaCat Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3997350/f2e4ee0c3bdd65f784545883299566fbd978fd95/header.jpg?t=1770115706","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Kingdom of Foundry","package_groups":[],"pc_req